# Wayward Waypoints (adoulin, call-only): a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin, SoA Pioneer Registration completed
# and Life on the Frontier current. Nothing begins or completes the quest or sets WW_Need_Shipilolo (GMs). Talks in
# pairs (Shipilolo's default, Pioneer Registration's 535 replaceDefault, then his script). Available, the var at 1:
# nothing; a trade: no onTrade, nothing. Accepted, the var at 0: nothing.
# The var at 2, Fertile Ground accepted without its bottle (GMs): Fertile Ground's 2850 answers first. Then 79,
# finished: the Waypoint Recalibration Kit (addKeyItem, no message), the var 0. The kit taken, the var at 1 (GMs): 79
# again. The var at 1 (a GM), the kit held: nothing. The kit taken, the quest completed (GMs), the var at 1: nothing.
lists WesternAdoulin/Shipilolo/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2850 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/79
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=86,0,-60.6 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Soa PioneerRegistration completed
mission Soa LifeOnTheFrontier current
charvar WW_Need_Shipilolo 1
item FlintStone
login
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # available, the var at 1: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
trade Shipilolo FlintStone x1           # available: no onTrade: nothing, the stone kept
quest Adoulin.WaywardWaypoints accepted # a GM
charvar WW_Need_Shipilolo 0             # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # the var at 0: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
charvar WW_Need_Shipilolo 2             # a GM
quest Adoulin.FertileGround accepted    # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # Fertile Ground first: 2850
finish-if-event                         # 2850's finish: the bottle
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # the var at 2, no kit: 79
finish-if-event                         # 79's finish: the kit, the var 0
delkeyitem WaypointRecalibrationKit     # a GM
charvar WW_Need_Shipilolo 1             # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # the var at 1, no kit: 79 again
finish-if-event                         # 79's finish: the kit, the var 0
charvar WW_Need_Shipilolo 1             # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # the kit held: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
delkeyitem WaypointRecalibrationKit     # a GM
quest Adoulin.WaywardWaypoints completed   # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # completed, the var at 1, no kit: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
